{"v":4,"catch":"收集可愛的毛茸茸的生物！","desc":"準備好與「我喜歡尋找毛寶寶」一起開始新的冒險吧，這是流行的隱藏物品遊戲系列的第七部分！\n在這款遊戲中，您將探索令人驚嘆的環境並尋找可愛的毛茸茸的生物以添加到您的收藏中。\n\n當您造訪許多不同的地點時，請找到所有的小豬、小貓、小鴨、小狗和許多其他毛茸茸的小動物！\n解決輕鬆的謎題，玩各種有趣的小遊戲，同時收集隱藏在美麗風景中的所有可愛的毛寶寶！\n\n- 總共 72 個 HO 場景\n- 24 章\n- 有趣的獎杯\n- 蝴蝶專輯","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2024-02-22","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.4GB / Switch 1.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85bdb5f8661df78cf4caef69b44f4a4c713ec0ab574edfd4187be52c2f032a58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1f12539eb74bd083f87490152d389148bfcc32a51c16a9778b44323cda6339c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3417a50e3a04494ec132af0a42459b215267224b836711437d96fb3ea41fbfdc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f7e9d0e92f2aa0a8c75e8558ba0dcbd7eb5ea7d74bbad0dac5c1e492fd6363f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91aac6367206ac91ae71115e7b0dd84e64fe2f15ad7fa2fcb208375e072187ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5886450383aaf6478daf305ccf00ee24b355e981f75ba57350f670eea4bdeb7a.jpg"],"titleId":"010027601b3e0000","dlc":[]}